1
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:08,830
(Leonard:)Problem?

2
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:11,240
(Howard:)This is the worst cobbler
I've ever eaten.

3
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:15,410
It tastes like it's made of
actual ground-up shoemaker.

4
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:18,980
(Sheldon:)Amusing. A play on the
two meanings of "cobbler."

5
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:24,220
(Raj:)Hey, guys. Guess who
I found at LAX?

6
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,550
(Raj:)My baby sister Priya.

7
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:27,720
(Sheldon:)Excuse me, I object.

8
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,920
(Sheldon:)You propose a guessing game,

9
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:31,890
(Sheldon:)yet you don't give me
enough time to guess.

10
00:00:31,890 --> 00:00:34,530
(Sheldon:)For the record,
I was going to say:

11
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:35,790
"Your sister Priya."

12
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:39,370
(Priya:)Oh, Sheldon. You haven't
changed a bit, have you?

13
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:41,470
(Sheldon:)Why would I change?

14
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:42,630
(Leonard:)The hope has been that

15
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:44,700
(Leonard:)you'd eventually bend
to public opinion.

16
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,840
(Leonard:)So, Priya, what brings
you back to L.A.?

17
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:49,980
I have a one-day layover
on my way to Toronto.

18
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,380
(Priya:)Corporate merger.

19
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:52,480
(Raj:)Can you believe it?

20
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:53,850
(Raj:)Little Priya's one
of the lead attorneys

21
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:55,280
(Raj:)for the biggest
car company in India.

22
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:58,320
(Sheldon:)Given that when we met her,
she was finishing law school

23
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:01,690
(Sheldon:)and planning an internship
at a large Indian car company,

